  "account": "文汇书香苑",
  "source_title": "顾方舟\n一位92岁老人临终前，手里攥着一颗乳牙——它来自60年前一个没能救回来的孩子。\n\n#顾方舟 #名人故事 #文字共鸣 #成长的力量 #感动 #励志故事 #读书感悟\n#微信小店://国朴雅维图书店/6rSii1ngkAIOhSy",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_de00087cd0f362d7_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 513.88,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "那颗乳牙他揣了一辈子，各位今儿个这个故事，我不跟你掰扯，那些数据也不讲那些惊天动地的场面，我就想跟你唠一颗乳牙和一个孩子没能等到的心愿。因为啊就是这么一颗小牙悄悄改写了好几亿人的命，故事的主角叫顾方舟。不过在说他之前，我想先让你认认一个叫阿楚的小娃。那是五十年代末，南方一家医院里头顾方舟，为了摸清一种阳明脊髓灰质炎，老百姓叫小儿麻痹症的病的底细，正到处搜罗资料。他背上包刚要抬腿，走，人一个脸都蜡黄了的汉子，一把薅住了。他同志，求求您哪救救我娃吧。顾方舟愣了下，大哥，您是不是认错人了？我不是看病的大夫，我是捣鼓病毒的。没错，没错，您就是搞这行的那您准有辙，您行行好，瞅瞅我娃顾方舟就这么被拽到了一个男孩的床前，那幅画面他记了一辈子一个本该在日头底下撒欢的半大娃两条腿，蜷着拧着变的形，硬生生被拴在了这张床上。他叫阿楚得的，正是那种专捡小娃娃欺负的病，轻的跛一辈子重的连口气都喘不利索。顾方舟鼻子一酸，亲口像被杀，狠狠攥了一吧。他蹲下去声音放的软软的。阿楚，你长大了想做个啥呀？娃的眼睛先亮了一下，又暗下去，小声嘟囔。我原先想当解放军，可现在我想当大夫，我想把小朋友们得的病一个个都治好，我还盼着往后头的小娃再也不用摊上这病了。说完，他小心翼翼打枕头底下，摸出一个东西塞进顾方舟，手心是一颗小小的，还带着他体温的乳牙牙。婆婆能替人圆梦的大伙听听，就在那一刹那，一个孩子的天真烂漫撞上了一个科学家的天梁顾方舟，攥紧那颗小牙，眼泪差点没绷住，这哪是颗牙啊。这分明是一个孩子对好好活一场的全部念想，是一个家在绝路上死死抓住的最后一根稻草。他跟自己较上了劲，我记下来这档子事儿，我管定了。后来外头都说，顾方舟捣鼓出糖丸是为了论文，是为了上头的任务。可只有他自己心里透亮，最开头那簇火苗是打一个陌生娃，手里接过来这颗小小的牙和那句听着就飘渺的心愿。揣着这句承诺，顾方舟一头扎进了疫苗研发那不见底的深渊。那会儿的中国是个啥家底像样的实验室，每一间做实验的猴子寻不着垫不稳钱，更没有这病。一年祸害成千上万的娃，上头急得直跺脚。眼前的道有两条，一条是美国的死疫苗稳当可疑，真十块美金。这病还分好几个型号，得连着挨好几针。那年月，一个普通人一个月就挣几十块钱，谁吃的消全国也覆盖不过来。另一条是活疫苗便宜，顶多死，疫苗的千分之一还能兑水喝。可全世界没一个敢拍胸脯说他保险顾方舟把牙一咬走活疫苗这条道，因为他答应过阿楚，要让往后的娃再别摊上这病。为了做实验，他带着队伍猫进了昆明大山深处的山洞，没水没电，做实验的料子得徒步十几公里扛上山。他索性把亲娘媳妇刚落地的小儿子一大家子全搬了过去。在荒山上，一砖一瓦抠出了个研究所，为啥这么玩命？因为他答应过一个娃，日子一天天熬，疫苗总算捣鼓出来，可猴子身上没事不代表人身上没事儿，谁敢投一个势顾方舟。又把自个儿往前推了一步，扬起脖把一瓶灌了下去。我是党员，我先来猴子，他不会开口，可我会灌完没啥事儿，他又琢磨出一个心坎，自个儿是大人，大人早就被这病毒磨出抵抗力了。可这病真正要命的是，那些三五岁的奶娃娃，得有个娃试才成成得这个当爹的做了一个让所有人后脊梁发凉的决定。他瞒着婆姨，把刚落地没多久的小儿子喂了那管疫苗，足足一个月，他日夜守在娃床边，盯着孩子每一个细小的动静，直到确认好好的一丁点岔子，没有才敢跟媳妇挑明。爱人又气又怕，哭了好半晌，大伙品品，他拿亲儿子的命去赌堵的究竟是是啥？不就是阿楚那句，往后的小朋友再也不用得这病了。后来，队里其他人的侍灵娃也陆陆续续入了实验组，这帮科研人员的崽成了咱中国头一波被唐王护住的娃。可顾方舟还不甘心，他发现呢液体的疫苗又苦又娇气，乡下山坳里的娃根本吃不上，有一回，他瞅见小孙子辈吃糖，那股子馋劲儿，脑子里钉一下，咋不捣鼓成堂呢？他和队伍一合计，把疫苗掺进葡萄糖奶粉里，搓成了一颗甜丝丝圆溜溜的小糖丸。外头瞅着跟寻常糖果没两样，娃高高兴兴就给咽下去了。打从六七十年代起，糖丸就在全国撒开了一代又一代的中国娃，就是裹着这么一口甜味儿，躲过了那场要命的瘟神来。我把结局摊给你看。九十年代后半截中国大地上再没冒出过一例本土的这种病例。跨进新世纪没多久，七十好几的顾方舟代表中国在消灭几徽的认证书上，一笔一画签下了自个儿的名。那个叫阿楚的男孩，没能亲眼瞧见的，将来他替他一点一点给圆上了。二零一九年，顾方舟走了九十二岁，有人念叨老人临走那会儿，手里还珍藏着那颗几十年的乳牙，一颗乳牙，一句童言被一个大男人记得一辈子气到把一个国家从瘟疫里拽了出来，气到让好几亿娃都能在日头底下撒丫子跑跳效果。今儿个我把这事儿讲给你听，不是非要删你的情，我就想让你晓得这世上真有这么一种大人，会把一个孩子随口嘟囔的心愿，当成自个儿一辈子的差事。你小时候含过的那颗甜丝丝的糖丸，是一个娃在病床上许下的愿，是一个当爹的拿亲儿子的命，替他兑现的诺言。你要是也被暖着了，就点个赞，收个藏，顺手转给你心尖上的人。尤其是要是是你家也有打小吃过那颗糖的老人，今晚替他们跟顾方舟爷爷道一声谢，记着他顾方舟糖丸爷爷。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 2790,
      "text": "那颗乳牙他揣了一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2890,
      "end_ms": 4230,
      "text": "各位今儿个这个故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4970,
      "end_ms": 5990,
      "text": "我不跟你掰扯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5990,
      "end_ms": 9970,
      "text": "那些数据也不讲那些惊天动地的场面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11110,
      "end_ms": 16309,
      "text": "我就想跟你唠一颗乳牙和一个孩子没能等到的心愿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00006",
      "start_ms": 17090,
      "end_ms": 23790,
      "text": "因为啊就是这么一颗小牙悄悄改写了好几亿人的命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00007",
      "start_ms": 25010,
      "end_ms": 29185,
      "text": "故事的主角叫顾方舟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00008",
      "start_ms": 30360,
      "end_ms": 31520,
      "text": "不过在说他之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00009",
      "start_ms": 32200,
      "end_ms": 35540,
      "text": "我想先让你认认一个叫阿楚的小娃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00010",
      "start_ms": 36100,
      "end_ms": 37340,
      "text": "那是五十年代末，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00011",
      "start_ms": 37620,
      "end_ms": 39620,
      "text": "南方一家医院里头顾方舟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00012",
      "start_ms": 39620,
      "end_ms": 42780,
      "text": "为了摸清一种阳明脊髓灰质炎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00013",
      "start_ms": 43380,
      "end_ms": 46300,
      "text": "老百姓叫小儿麻痹症的病的底细，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00014",
      "start_ms": 47140,
      "end_ms": 48640,
      "text": "正到处搜罗资料。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00015",
      "start_ms": 49280,
      "end_ms": 51400,
      "text": "他背上包刚要抬腿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00016",
      "start_ms": 51420,
      "end_ms": 51640,
      "text": "走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00017",
      "start_ms": 51640,
      "end_ms": 54200,
      "text": "人一个脸都蜡黄了的汉子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00018",
      "start_ms": 54640,
      "end_ms": 55580,
      "text": "一把薅住了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00019",
      "start_ms": 55580,
      "end_ms": 56180,
      "text": "他同志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00020",
      "start_ms": 56480,
      "end_ms": 58340,
      "text": "求求您哪救救我娃吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00021",
      "start_ms": 59520,
      "end_ms": 60665,
      "text": "顾方舟愣了下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00022",
      "start_ms": 61520,
      "end_ms": 62105,
      "text": "大哥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00023",
      "start_ms": 62920,
      "end_ms": 64385,
      "text": "您是不是认错人了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00024",
      "start_ms": 65630,
      "end_ms": 67255,
      "text": "我不是看病的大夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00025",
      "start_ms": 68510,
      "end_ms": 70335,
      "text": "我是捣鼓病毒的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00026",
      "start_ms": 70990,
      "end_ms": 71370,
      "text": "没错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00027",
      "start_ms": 71370,
      "end_ms": 71770,
      "text": "没错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00028",
      "start_ms": 71930,
      "end_ms": 74440,
      "text": "您就是搞这行的那您准有辙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74660,
      "end_ms": 75440,
      "text": "您行行好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00030",
      "start_ms": 75540,
      "end_ms": 80730,
      "text": "瞅瞅我娃顾方舟就这么被拽到了一个男孩的床前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00031",
      "start_ms": 80730,
      "end_ms": 87960,
      "text": "那幅画面他记了一辈子一个本该在日头底下撒欢的半大娃两条腿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00032",
      "start_ms": 88040,
      "end_ms": 90455,
      "text": "蜷着拧着变的形，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00033",
      "start_ms": 90860,
      "end_ms": 93395,
      "text": "硬生生被拴在了这张床上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00034",
      "start_ms": 93790,
      "end_ms": 95590,
      "text": "他叫阿楚得的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00035",
      "start_ms": 95590,
      "end_ms": 98830,
      "text": "正是那种专捡小娃娃欺负的病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00036",
      "start_ms": 98870,
      "end_ms": 102895,
      "text": "轻的跛一辈子重的连口气都喘不利索。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00037",
      "start_ms": 103460,
      "end_ms": 104865,
      "text": "顾方舟鼻子一酸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00038",
      "start_ms": 105230,
      "end_ms": 106370,
      "text": "亲口像被杀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00039",
      "start_ms": 106470,
      "end_ms": 107775,
      "text": "狠狠攥了一吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00040",
      "start_ms": 108280,
      "end_ms": 111425,
      "text": "他蹲下去声音放的软软的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00041",
      "start_ms": 111550,
      "end_ms": 112005,
      "text": "阿楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00042",
      "start_ms": 112380,
      "end_ms": 113905,
      "text": "你长大了想做个啥呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00043",
      "start_ms": 114670,
      "end_ms": 116370,
      "text": "娃的眼睛先亮了一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00044",
      "start_ms": 116550,
      "end_ms": 117485,
      "text": "又暗下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00045",
      "start_ms": 117990,
      "end_ms": 118825,
      "text": "小声嘟囔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00046",
      "start_ms": 119720,
      "end_ms": 122055,
      "text": "我原先想当解放军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00047",
      "start_ms": 122400,
      "end_ms": 124325,
      "text": "可现在我想当大夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00048",
      "start_ms": 125250,
      "end_ms": 128605,
      "text": "我想把小朋友们得的病一个个都治好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00049",
      "start_ms": 128970,
      "end_ms": 133555,
      "text": "我还盼着往后头的小娃再也不用摊上这病了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00050",
      "start_ms": 134210,
      "end_ms": 134765,
      "text": "说完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00051",
      "start_ms": 135140,
      "end_ms": 137160,
      "text": "他小心翼翼打枕头底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00052",
      "start_ms": 137160,
      "end_ms": 139560,
      "text": "摸出一个东西塞进顾方舟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00053",
      "start_ms": 139560,
      "end_ms": 141115,
      "text": "手心是一颗小小的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00054",
      "start_ms": 141730,
      "end_ms": 146330,
      "text": "还带着他体温的乳牙牙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00055",
      "start_ms": 146330,
      "end_ms": 151210,
      "text": "婆婆能替人圆梦的大伙听听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00056",
      "start_ms": 151290,
      "end_ms": 152450,
      "text": "就在那一刹那，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00057",
      "start_ms": 152470,
      "end_ms": 158750,
      "text": "一个孩子的天真烂漫撞上了一个科学家的天梁顾方舟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00058",
      "start_ms": 158810,
      "end_ms": 160055,
      "text": "攥紧那颗小牙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00059",
      "start_ms": 160570,
      "end_ms": 162045,
      "text": "眼泪差点没绷住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00060",
      "start_ms": 163040,
      "end_ms": 164195,
      "text": "这哪是颗牙啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00061",
      "start_ms": 164610,
      "end_ms": 168505,
      "text": "这分明是一个孩子对好好活一场的全部念想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00062",
      "start_ms": 169130,
      "end_ms": 173875,
      "text": "是一个家在绝路上死死抓住的最后一根稻草。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00063",
      "start_ms": 174790,
      "end_ms": 176245,
      "text": "他跟自己较上了劲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00064",
      "start_ms": 178340,
      "end_ms": 180315,
      "text": "我记下来这档子事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00065",
      "start_ms": 180700,
      "end_ms": 181625,
      "text": "我管定了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00066",
      "start_ms": 182660,
      "end_ms": 183895,
      "text": "后来外头都说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00067",
      "start_ms": 184780,
      "end_ms": 187925,
      "text": "顾方舟捣鼓出糖丸是为了论文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00068",
      "start_ms": 188270,
      "end_ms": 189830,
      "text": "是为了上头的任务。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00069",
      "start_ms": 189990,
      "end_ms": 191790,
      "text": "可只有他自己心里透亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00070",
      "start_ms": 191810,
      "end_ms": 194830,
      "text": "最开头那簇火苗是打一个陌生娃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00071",
      "start_ms": 194850,
      "end_ms": 200665,
      "text": "手里接过来这颗小小的牙和那句听着就飘渺的心愿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00072",
      "start_ms": 201520,
      "end_ms": 202675,
      "text": "揣着这句承诺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00073",
      "start_ms": 203160,
      "end_ms": 206875,
      "text": "顾方舟一头扎进了疫苗研发那不见底的深渊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00074",
      "start_ms": 207460,
      "end_ms": 211190,
      "text": "那会儿的中国是个啥家底像样的实验室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00075",
      "start_ms": 211250,
      "end_ms": 215280,
      "text": "每一间做实验的猴子寻不着垫不稳钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00076",
      "start_ms": 215360,
      "end_ms": 216820,
      "text": "更没有这病。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00077",
      "start_ms": 216940,
      "end_ms": 219295,
      "text": "一年祸害成千上万的娃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00078",
      "start_ms": 219640,
      "end_ms": 220905,
      "text": "上头急得直跺脚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00079",
      "start_ms": 221400,
      "end_ms": 223210,
      "text": "眼前的道有两条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00080",
      "start_ms": 223410,
      "end_ms": 227040,
      "text": "一条是美国的死疫苗稳当可疑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00081",
      "start_ms": 227040,
      "end_ms": 228595,
      "text": "真十块美金。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00082",
      "start_ms": 229110,
      "end_ms": 230905,
      "text": "这病还分好几个型号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00083",
      "start_ms": 231760,
      "end_ms": 233000,
      "text": "得连着挨好几针。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00084",
      "start_ms": 233000,
      "end_ms": 233500,
      "text": "那年月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00085",
      "start_ms": 233500,
      "end_ms": 235775,
      "text": "一个普通人一个月就挣几十块钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00086",
      "start_ms": 236260,
      "end_ms": 239275,
      "text": "谁吃的消全国也覆盖不过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00087",
      "start_ms": 239750,
      "end_ms": 243100,
      "text": "另一条是活疫苗便宜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00088",
      "start_ms": 243160,
      "end_ms": 243840,
      "text": "顶多死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00089",
      "start_ms": 243840,
      "end_ms": 246455,
      "text": "疫苗的千分之一还能兑水喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00090",
      "start_ms": 247180,
      "end_ms": 253755,
      "text": "可全世界没一个敢拍胸脯说他保险顾方舟把牙一咬走活疫苗这条道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00091",
      "start_ms": 254600,
      "end_ms": 255960,
      "text": "因为他答应过阿楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00092",
      "start_ms": 256120,
      "end_ms": 258615,
      "text": "要让往后的娃再别摊上这病。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00093",
      "start_ms": 258990,
      "end_ms": 259895,
      "text": "为了做实验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00094",
      "start_ms": 260290,
      "end_ms": 264045,
      "text": "他带着队伍猫进了昆明大山深处的山洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00095",
      "start_ms": 264540,
      "end_ms": 265485,
      "text": "没水没电，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00096",
      "start_ms": 265940,
      "end_ms": 269215,
      "text": "做实验的料子得徒步十几公里扛上山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00097",
      "start_ms": 269930,
      "end_ms": 275245,
      "text": "他索性把亲娘媳妇刚落地的小儿子一大家子全搬了过去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00098",
      "start_ms": 275650,
      "end_ms": 276525,
      "text": "在荒山上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00099",
      "start_ms": 276830,
      "end_ms": 279125,
      "text": "一砖一瓦抠出了个研究所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00100",
      "start_ms": 279570,
      "end_ms": 280575,
      "text": "为啥这么玩命？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00101",
      "start_ms": 280850,
      "end_ms": 282295,
      "text": "因为他答应过一个娃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00102",
      "start_ms": 282910,
      "end_ms": 284155,
      "text": "日子一天天熬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00103",
      "start_ms": 284520,
      "end_ms": 286205,
      "text": "疫苗总算捣鼓出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00104",
      "start_ms": 287210,
      "end_ms": 290760,
      "text": "可猴子身上没事不代表人身上没事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00105",
      "start_ms": 290760,
      "end_ms": 292725,
      "text": "谁敢投一个势顾方舟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00106",
      "start_ms": 293260,
      "end_ms": 295080,
      "text": "又把自个儿往前推了一步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00107",
      "start_ms": 295360,
      "end_ms": 297880,
      "text": "扬起脖把一瓶灌了下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00108",
      "start_ms": 298580,
      "end_ms": 299320,
      "text": "我是党员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00109",
      "start_ms": 299560,
      "end_ms": 301720,
      "text": "我先来猴子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00110",
      "start_ms": 301720,
      "end_ms": 302620,
      "text": "他不会开口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00111",
      "start_ms": 304360,
      "end_ms": 306800,
      "text": "可我会灌完没啥事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00112",
      "start_ms": 306800,
      "end_ms": 308800,
      "text": "他又琢磨出一个心坎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00113",
      "start_ms": 308800,
      "end_ms": 310060,
      "text": "自个儿是大人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00114",
      "start_ms": 310060,
      "end_ms": 313480,
      "text": "大人早就被这病毒磨出抵抗力了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00115",
      "start_ms": 313480,
      "end_ms": 315760,
      "text": "可这病真正要命的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00116",
      "start_ms": 315760,
      "end_ms": 318320,
      "text": "那些三五岁的奶娃娃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00117",
      "start_ms": 318340,
      "end_ms": 326150,
      "text": "得有个娃试才成成得这个当爹的做了一个让所有人后脊梁发凉的决定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00118",
      "start_ms": 326210,
      "end_ms": 327210,
      "text": "他瞒着婆姨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00119",
      "start_ms": 327270,
      "end_ms": 331150,
      "text": "把刚落地没多久的小儿子喂了那管疫苗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00120",
      "start_ms": 331770,
      "end_ms": 332770,
      "text": "足足一个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00121",
      "start_ms": 333170,
      "end_ms": 335510,
      "text": "他日夜守在娃床边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00122",
      "start_ms": 335930,
      "end_ms": 338690,
      "text": "盯着孩子每一个细小的动静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00123",
      "start_ms": 339170,
      "end_ms": 342470,
      "text": "直到确认好好的一丁点岔子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00124",
      "start_ms": 342470,
      "end_ms": 344610,
      "text": "没有才敢跟媳妇挑明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00125",
      "start_ms": 344610,
      "end_ms": 346710,
      "text": "爱人又气又怕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00126",
      "start_ms": 346710,
      "end_ms": 347730,
      "text": "哭了好半晌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00127",
      "start_ms": 347730,
      "end_ms": 349330,
      "text": "大伙品品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00128",
      "start_ms": 349330,
      "end_ms": 353420,
      "text": "他拿亲儿子的命去赌堵的究竟是是啥？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00129",
      "start_ms": 353910,
      "end_ms": 355010,
      "text": "不就是阿楚那句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00130",
      "start_ms": 355010,
      "end_ms": 358265,
      "text": "往后的小朋友再也不用得这病了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00131",
      "start_ms": 358600,
      "end_ms": 359040,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00132",
      "start_ms": 359260,
      "end_ms": 363280,
      "text": "队里其他人的侍灵娃也陆陆续续入了实验组，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00133",
      "start_ms": 363420,
      "end_ms": 368395,
      "text": "这帮科研人员的崽成了咱中国头一波被唐王护住的娃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00134",
      "start_ms": 369220,
      "end_ms": 370765,
      "text": "可顾方舟还不甘心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00135",
      "start_ms": 371270,
      "end_ms": 374645,
      "text": "他发现呢液体的疫苗又苦又娇气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00136",
      "start_ms": 375210,
      "end_ms": 377925,
      "text": "乡下山坳里的娃根本吃不上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00137",
      "start_ms": 378360,
      "end_ms": 378900,
      "text": "有一回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00138",
      "start_ms": 379120,
      "end_ms": 381040,
      "text": "他瞅见小孙子辈吃糖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00139",
      "start_ms": 381120,
      "end_ms": 382175,
      "text": "那股子馋劲儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00140",
      "start_ms": 382680,
      "end_ms": 383760,
      "text": "脑子里钉一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00141",
      "start_ms": 383760,
      "end_ms": 385065,
      "text": "咋不捣鼓成堂呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00142",
      "start_ms": 385520,
      "end_ms": 386545,
      "text": "他和队伍一合计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00143",
      "start_ms": 386910,
      "end_ms": 389795,
      "text": "把疫苗掺进葡萄糖奶粉里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00144",
      "start_ms": 390260,
      "end_ms": 393665,
      "text": "搓成了一颗甜丝丝圆溜溜的小糖丸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00145",
      "start_ms": 394250,
      "end_ms": 396830,
      "text": "外头瞅着跟寻常糖果没两样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00146",
      "start_ms": 396830,
      "end_ms": 399125,
      "text": "娃高高兴兴就给咽下去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00147",
      "start_ms": 399980,
      "end_ms": 401835,
      "text": "打从六七十年代起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00148",
      "start_ms": 402110,
      "end_ms": 406905,
      "text": "糖丸就在全国撒开了一代又一代的中国娃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00149",
      "start_ms": 407270,
      "end_ms": 409555,
      "text": "就是裹着这么一口甜味儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00150",
      "start_ms": 410010,
      "end_ms": 412135,
      "text": "躲过了那场要命的瘟神来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00151",
      "start_ms": 412680,
      "end_ms": 414000,
      "text": "我把结局摊给你看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00152",
      "start_ms": 414000,
      "end_ms": 420065,
      "text": "九十年代后半截中国大地上再没冒出过一例本土的这种病例。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00153",
      "start_ms": 420510,
      "end_ms": 422205,
      "text": "跨进新世纪没多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00154",
      "start_ms": 422780,
      "end_ms": 428025,
      "text": "七十好几的顾方舟代表中国在消灭几徽的认证书上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00155",
      "start_ms": 428400,
      "end_ms": 430895,
      "text": "一笔一画签下了自个儿的名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00156",
      "start_ms": 431150,
      "end_ms": 432595,
      "text": "那个叫阿楚的男孩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00157",
      "start_ms": 432960,
      "end_ms": 434400,
      "text": "没能亲眼瞧见的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00158",
      "start_ms": 434400,
      "end_ms": 437985,
      "text": "将来他替他一点一点给圆上了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00159",
      "start_ms": 438990,
      "end_ms": 439830,
      "text": "二零一九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00160",
      "start_ms": 439830,
      "end_ms": 443065,
      "text": "顾方舟走了九十二岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00161",
      "start_ms": 443980,
      "end_ms": 447995,
      "text": "有人念叨老人临走那会儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00162",
      "start_ms": 448320,
      "end_ms": 451485,
      "text": "手里还珍藏着那颗几十年的乳牙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00163",
      "start_ms": 452130,
      "end_ms": 453015,
      "text": "一颗乳牙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00164",
      "start_ms": 453280,
      "end_ms": 460015,
      "text": "一句童言被一个大男人记得一辈子气到把一个国家从瘟疫里拽了出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00165",
      "start_ms": 460420,
      "end_ms": 466095,
      "text": "气到让好几亿娃都能在日头底下撒丫子跑跳效果。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00166",
      "start_ms": 466370,
      "end_ms": 468100,
      "text": "今儿个我把这事儿讲给你听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00167",
      "start_ms": 468140,
      "end_ms": 469675,
      "text": "不是非要删你的情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00168",
      "start_ms": 470680,
      "end_ms": 474310,
      "text": "我就想让你晓得这世上真有这么一种大人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00169",
      "start_ms": 474650,
      "end_ms": 477850,
      "text": "会把一个孩子随口嘟囔的心愿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00170",
      "start_ms": 478270,
      "end_ms": 480370,
      "text": "当成自个儿一辈子的差事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00171",
      "start_ms": 480889,
      "end_ms": 484370,
      "text": "你小时候含过的那颗甜丝丝的糖丸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00172",
      "start_ms": 484850,
      "end_ms": 488430,
      "text": "是一个娃在病床上许下的愿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00173",
      "start_ms": 488950,
      "end_ms": 492210,
      "text": "是一个当爹的拿亲儿子的命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00174",
      "start_ms": 492610,
      "end_ms": 494370,
      "text": "替他兑现的诺言。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00175",
      "start_ms": 494950,
      "end_ms": 496510,
      "text": "你要是也被暖着了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00176",
      "start_ms": 496850,
      "end_ms": 497710,
      "text": "就点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00177",
      "start_ms": 498010,
      "end_ms": 498610,
      "text": "收个藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00178",
      "start_ms": 499070,
      "end_ms": 501790,
      "text": "顺手转给你心尖上的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00179",
      "start_ms": 501970,
      "end_ms": 505920,
      "text": "尤其是要是是你家也有打小吃过那颗糖的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00180",
      "start_ms": 506460,
      "end_ms": 510160,
      "text": "今晚替他们跟顾方舟爷爷道一声谢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de00087cd0f362d7_s00181",
      "start_ms": 511060,
      "end_ms": 513795,
      "text": "记着他顾方舟糖丸爷爷。"
    }
  ],
